# No Fabricated Business Content

NEVER invent, generate, or attribute content to Hop Yard Ale Works or any real person unless the owner explicitly provides it word-for-word in this conversation.

## Prohibited

- Quotes attributed to "Hop Yard Ale Works" or any staff member
- Testimonials from customers
- Made-up facts about the brewery, history, recipes, or awards
- Slogans or taglines invented by the AI and presented as official brand voice
- Any hardcoded string that implies the business said or did something specific

## Allowed

- Placeholder copy clearly marked as `TODO: replace with real copy`
- Generic UI labels (button text, form labels, navigation)
- Quotes from clearly credited third parties (Dave Barry, Plato, etc.) that are real and verifiable
- Paraphrasing or reformatting copy the owner has explicitly provided

## If Unsure

Leave a `// TODO: confirm with owner` comment instead of inventing content. Never fill a gap with something that could be mistaken for an official statement.
